# sdist 必須能獨立重建、測試與審視：文件、範例目標、完整測試套件（含 tests/conftest.py 的假 litellm）、
# 相依與鎖定檔、沙盒 Dockerfile 與其雜湊鎖定檔、複合 action 與專案政策檔都要附上。
# tests/test_review_build.py 與 tests.yml 的 package job 會檢查 sdist 內容。
# The sdist must be rebuildable, testable and reviewable on its own: docs, the sample target, the full test
# suite (including the fake litellm in tests/conftest.py), dependency and lock files, the sandbox Dockerfiles
# with their hashed lock, the composite action and the project policy files all ship.
# tests/test_review_build.py and the package job in tests.yml check the sdist contents.
include README.md README.en.md CHANGELOG.md CHANGELOG.en.md CONTRIBUTING.md SECURITY.md LICENSE
include main.py action.yml
include requirements.txt requirements-dev.txt requirements.lock requirements-build.in requirements-build.txt
include docker/*.Dockerfile docker/sandbox-requirements.in docker/sandbox-requirements.txt
recursive-include docs *.md
recursive-include examples *.py
recursive-include tests *.py
recursive-include vibeharness/config *.yaml
global-exclude __pycache__ *.py[cod]
